<TITLE>Steering Sensor</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>A steering sensor is provided in the combination switch. Detects the steering amount and direction and inputs them to the skid control computer.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The sensor section has 2 sets of magnetoresistive elements that detect the rotation of a magnet built into the detection gear, and detects steering rotation from the change in magnetic resistance as the detection gear rotates.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
